  "description": "Do you want off-road performance and state-of-the-art e-bike technology at a top price? Then the Copperhead EVO models are exactly what you're looking for. Whether ambitious trail tours or sporty off-road rides, full suspension with the latest 4-link swing arm technology (except Copperhead EVO AM 1) or as a fast hardtail - off-road riding fun is guaranteed. Powerful torque for tough climbs is provided by the most powerful Bosch drive with compact mini remote and system controller. In addition, the frame is manufactured using the high-quality monocoque casting process. This offers a further innovative highlight with integrated MonkeyLink steering light in the head tube and MonkeyLink Twinlight rear light in the dropout. Safe lighting is therefore always on board, even on sporty rides.",
